    <string name="desc_kursi">Aayadda ugu weyn Quraanka; ilaalin ka dhig.</string>
    <string name="desc_protect">Ilaalin iyo ka-magan-gelid Allaah.</string>
    <string name="desc_baqara_end">Labada aayadood ee ugu dambeeya Al-Baqara; qofka habeenkii akhriya way ku filan yihiin.</string>
    <string name="desc_noharm">Magaca Allaah, kan magaciisa lagu daro aan waxba dhib gaarsiin karin dhulka iyo samada.</string>
    <string name="desc_radiitu">Waan ku raalli ahay Allaah inuu Rabbigeyga yahay, Islaamka inuu diinteyda yahay, Muxammadna inuu nabigeyga yahay.</string>
    <string name="desc_bihamdihi">Allaah waa nadiif, ammaanta oo dhanna waa u sugnaatay.</string>
    <string name="desc_istighfar">Waxaan dambi dhaaf weydiistaa Allaah.</string>
    <string name="desc_salaam">Allaahow adigaa Nabad ah, nabaddana adigaa ka timaada; waad barakaysantahay, Sayidka weynaanta iyo sharafta.</string>
    <string name="desc_tasbih">Allaah waa nadiif.</string>
    <string name="desc_tahmid">Ammaanta oo dhan Allaah ayay u sugnaatay.</string>
    <string name="desc_takbir">Allaah waa ugu weyn.</string>
    <string name="desc_tahlil">Ma jiro ilaah xaq u mudan in la caabudo Allaah mooyee, isaga keligiis, shariik ma leh; boqortooyada iyo ammaanta waa leeyahay, wax kasta oo uu karaa.</string>
    <string name="desc_bismika">Magacaaga Allaahow, waan dhimanayaa oo waan noolaanayaa (hurdada).</string>
    <string name="desc_wake">Ammaanta Allaah ayay u sugnaatay, kan na soo nooleeyay markuu na dilay ka dib, isagaana loo soo noqonayaa.</string>
    <string name="desc_eat_before">Magaca Allaah, marka aad cuntada bilaabayso.</string>
    <string name="desc_eat_after">Ammaanta Allaah ayay u sugnaatay, kan i quudiyay kanna i siiyay, anigoon xoog iyo awood lahayn.</string>
    <string name="desc_hawqala">Ma jiro awood iyo xoog Allaah mooyee.</string>
    <string name="desc_salawat">Allaahow nabigeenna Muxammad ku nasii oo nabad u sii.</string>
    <string name="desc_rabbana">Rabbigayaga, nagu sii wanaag adduunka iyo aakhiraba, na dhawr cadaabka dabka (Al-Baqara 2:201).</string>

